<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Datamat Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Datamat Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Second quarter</p>
<p>				   1997		     1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	 2.92     vs  loss    1.09</p>
<p>    Net	   loss     156.39     vs  loss   41.99</p>
<p>					    Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	 4.30     vs   loss    0.99</p>
<p>    Net	   loss     230.38     vs   loss   38.01</p>
<p>Notes: Results are reviewed. The company's full name is Datamat Plc, a computer sales and servicing company.</p>
